#   lines from install.sh and the gate keyed presence only. CM051 #1841 makes 
#   a removal measurable by asserting the deleted line is ABSENT from the 
#   pinned blob, and adds a test deriving cut.yml's gate list so new_cut.sh 
#   cannot print ALL GREEN while a hard preflight gate is missing from its 
